    "head_commit_message": "feat(ci): the digests job traces the runs whose outcomes changed (spec 37 step 3)\n\ncheck_outcomes.py gains --changed <file>, writing <run>\\t<first tick> per changed run.\nWhen it writes any, the digests job traces the first 3 on the base's worktree and on\nthe branch (trace_changed.sh: 20 ticks before the first difference to 40 after),\ndiffs them with trace_diff.py into traces/ in sim-digests-<set>, and the summary shows\neach diff's first line. A base that can't trace yet is said, not failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjD7H88Dqd82gjeBS3Xmyo",
